+    "intuition_type": "invariant",
+    "intuition_description": (
+        "Four clauses on one variable triple encode a parity row, and the "
+        "coupled row operator is an involution, so applying it twice recovers "
+        "the assignment without general SAT search."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Section 1 Algorithm PPZ and Theorem 3.2 give exponential "
+        "general 3-SAT routes, while XOR extraction followed by GF(2) Gaussian "
+        "elimination solves this distribution in O(n^3); at the shipping "
+        "preset the measured reference cost is filled from selftest_report.json, "
+        "whereas the involution route uses exactly 2n binary XORs."
