The local exact gates reproduce, and the construction’s algebra is sound. I found one evidence gap worth fixing before any oracle rerun: the claimed 160-operation involution shortcut was described but never implemented or measured. I’ll add that exact compact solver to the audit path and separately report its 160 XORs versus the clause-inspection/bookkeeping cost, so G9 is not supported by an untested assertion.
