+key normalizes variable renumbering and input ordering but treats literal polarity as
+part of the signed formula; full signed-CNF isomorphism is not attempted. Most
+importantly, the required four-vendor and G9 diagnostics remain unavailable because of
+the external quota failure, so the local measurements do not establish the final
+hardness requirement.
