codex
The audit found a real G8 defect: complementing both variables in any hidden pair gives an equivalent generated signed-CNF, but the old key changed. I’ve replaced it with a cycle/hypergraph invariant that quotients those polarity changes and added a 20-seed composed symmetry test; unrelated instances remain distinct. Next I’m rerunning every local gate from the modified module.
