codex
The first `medium` attempt was solved exactly despite 576 shuffled clauses. That is useful evidence: the model can execute the parity extraction at this size, so the family’s difficulty is not merely asserted from operation counts. The harness is continuing through the remaining medium attempts and will move to `hard` because at least one solve already occurred.
